```
$ for u in Assignment-Options.html Variable-Assignment-Options.html Options.html; do curl -sS -o /dev/null \
    -w 'http=%{http_code} size=%{size_download} time=%{time_total}\n' --max-time 45 "$u"; done
curl: (28) Connection timed out after 45001 milliseconds      http=000 size=0 time=45.001  rc=28   (x3)
$ curl ... --max-time 20 https://www.gnu.org/software/gawk/manual/html_node/index.html
