2001:470:142:5::116 www.gnu.org
$ curl -v ... (tail)
* Host www.gnu.org:443 was resolved.  * IPv6: 2001:470:142:5::116  * IPv4: 209.51.188.116
*   Trying [2001:470:142:5::116]:443...  *   Trying 209.51.188.116:443...
